<h2>Question and recommendation</h2>
<p>Decision <a href="/backlog/3610-how-far-to-take-heavy-command-admission-control-beyond-stage/">#3610</a> asks how far to take host admission beyond visibility. The current tree already has resource sampling, shared admission verdicts, and bounded fast-slot scaling. The recommended rule is an <strong>independently configured capacity envelope</strong>; fixed, EWMA and learned targets can all operate within it. No controller is implemented or promoted by this research.</p>
